{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107330","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107330","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1210733001:1":{"text":"ゴホッ、ゴホッ！","source_cn":"咳咳、咳咳咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x139A683F8F75B7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1210733002:1":{"text":"やれやれ、年には勝てないな……","source_cn":"到底还是老了，不如以前了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A7CDC05B6DD994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210733003:1":{"text":"体は弱り、動きも鈍くなった……昔の私なら、お前らに勝ち目などなかったはずだ。","source_cn":"如果我还年轻，体魄强健，手指灵活……你们不是我的对手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC709878FE3DC2C63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210733004:1":{"text":"あんたの時代はもう終わったんだ。","source_cn":"属于你的时代已经过去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86D52C1299849D6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210733005:1":{"text":"歯がゆいものだな……","source_cn":"是吗？我不甘心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1350DC8D1D2948CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210733006:1":{"text":"穏やかに老後を過ごす選択もあったはずだろう。","source_cn":"你本来可以安度晚年的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41B73BC5D519F3C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210733007:1":{"text":"ふっ……穏やかな老後だと？海辺で日なたぼっこでもしろというのか？そんな生活、死んだ方がマシだ！","source_cn":"呵呵……安度晚年？无所事事地吹海风、晒太阳？那种生活…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x287027556F670D64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210733008:1":{"text":"ソニア、お前を引き取ったときから、将来私の右腕になれる逸材だと分かっていた。","source_cn":"索尼娅，收养你的时候，我就知道你会有出息。你会成为我的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EDC7B1AB560A893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210733009:1":{"text":"だがお前に私の命までは奪わせやしない。組織を率いる年寄りから権力を奪うのは、死の宣告と同じだ。","source_cn":"但是，你不能夺走我的生命。对于一个掌控帮派的老人，失去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C1ABD6BEDEA895","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210733010:1":{"text":"お前が実の娘だったらな……永遠に私のそばに置いておけたものを。","source_cn":"多希望你真的是我孩子……那样你就会永远在身边辅佐我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40C405E828A7FFC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210733011:1":{"text":"あんたの手下は亡霊だらけだ。そうならなくて心底よかったよ。","source_cn":"你手下的亡魂太多。我很庆幸我不是。","s